            '**D.** → True\n\nKeeping the early GDP force $0.03$ all the way to $t=15$ would give a single per-capita force $0.02$.\n\n$$\ny_{\\mathrm{wrong}}=50 e^{0.02\\cdot15}=50 e^{0.3}\\approx67.4929\n$$\n\nThe true piecewise level is lower.\n\n$$\ny_{\\mathrm{wrong}}\\approx67.4929\\neq y(15)\\approx58.0917\n$$\n\nIgnoring the GDP switch therefore mis-states the terminal per-capita level.\n\nSo the statement is True.',
